---
// Animated diagram for the keepalive post: what a Supabase keepalive probe reached before and after
// Greenlight 0.9. Before, the probe asked PostgREST for /rest/v1/, which PostgREST answers from its
// schema cache, so Postgres never saw a query and its 7-day idle timer kept running. After, the
// probe selects one row from a table, which has to reach Postgres and resets the timer.
// Pure SVG + CSS (no client JS). With reduced motion the packets are hidden and each row shows its
// end state: an empty timer marked "paused" before, a full one after.
---

<figure class="probe">
  <svg
    viewBox="0 0 420 262"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="probe-title probe-desc"
  >
    <title id="probe-title">What the keepalive probe reached, before and after Greenlight 0.9</title>
    <desc id="probe-desc">
      Two rows, each showing the keepalive Worker, PostgREST and Postgres. In the first row the
      probe requests /rest/v1/, PostgREST answers from its schema cache, Postgres sees no query and
      its seven-day idle timer runs out. In the second row the probe selects one row from a table,
      the request reaches Postgres, and the idle timer resets.
    </desc>

    <!-- Row 1: before -->
    <g class="row before">
      <circle class="packet p-before" cx="106" cy="52" r="6" />
      <text class="row-label" x="0" y="16">Greenlight 0.8 — GET /rest/v1/</text>
      <rect class="box" x="0" y="30" width="100" height="44" rx="8" />
      <text class="box-label" x="50" y="57">Worker</text>
      <rect class="box cacheable" x="160" y="30" width="100" height="44" rx="8" />
      <text class="box-label" x="210" y="57">PostgREST</text>
      <rect class="box" x="320" y="30" width="100" height="44" rx="8" />
      <text class="box-label" x="370" y="57">Postgres</text>

      <line class="wire" x1="100" y1="52" x2="160" y2="52" />
      <line class="wire idle" x1="260" y1="52" x2="320" y2="52" />
      <text class="note" x="290" y="44">no query</text>

      <text class="note" x="210" y="94">answered from schema cache</text>

      <rect class="timer-track" x="320" y="84" width="100" height="8" rx="4" />
      <rect class="timer drain" x="320" y="84" width="100" height="8" rx="4" />
      <text class="note" x="370" y="108">7-day idle timer</text>
      <text class="paused" x="370" y="124">paused</text>

    </g>

    <!-- Row 2: after -->
    <g class="row after" transform="translate(0 136)">
      <circle class="packet p-after" cx="106" cy="52" r="6" />
      <text class="row-label" x="0" y="16">Greenlight 0.9 — GET /rest/v1/&lt;table&gt;?limit=1</text>
      <rect class="box" x="0" y="30" width="100" height="44" rx="8" />
      <text class="box-label" x="50" y="57">Worker</text>
      <rect class="box" x="160" y="30" width="100" height="44" rx="8" />
      <text class="box-label" x="210" y="57">PostgREST</text>
      <rect class="box reached" x="320" y="30" width="100" height="44" rx="8" />
      <text class="box-label" x="370" y="57">Postgres</text>

      <line class="wire" x1="100" y1="52" x2="160" y2="52" />
      <line class="wire" x1="260" y1="52" x2="320" y2="52" />
      <text class="note" x="290" y="44">SELECT</text>

      <rect class="timer-track" x="320" y="84" width="100" height="8" rx="4" />
      <rect class="timer reset" x="320" y="84" width="100" height="8" rx="4" />
      <text class="note" x="370" y="108">timer resets</text>

    </g>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>
    An illustration of one probe per cycle. The first request succeeds without Postgres ever seeing
    it, so the idle timer runs out. The second can only be answered by running a query.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .probe {
    margin: 1.8rem 0 2.2rem;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 34rem;
    height: auto;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .row-label {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    fill: var(--fg);
  }
  .box {
    fill: var(--bg-subtle);
    stroke: var(--border);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .box-label {
    font-size: 15px;
    text-anchor: middle;
    fill: var(--fg);
  }
  .note {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    text-anchor: middle;
    fill: var(--fg-muted);
  }
  .wire {
    stroke: var(--fg-muted);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .wire.idle {
    stroke-dasharray: 3 4;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .timer-track {
    fill: var(--border);
  }
  .timer {
    fill: var(--accent);
    transform-box: fill-box;
    transform-origin: left center;
  }
  .paused {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-anchor: middle;
    fill: var(--warn);
  }
  .packet {
    fill: var(--accent);
    stroke: var(--bg);
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  /* Static end states: what reduced-motion readers (and any browser that skips the animation) see. */
  .timer.drain {
    transform: scaleX(0);
  }
  .timer.reset {
    transform: scaleX(1);
  }
  .packet {
    opacity: 0;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
    .packet {
      animation: 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .p-before {
      animation-name: probe-before;
    }
    .p-after {
      animation-name: probe-after;
    }
    .timer.drain {
      animation: drain 6s linear infinite;
    }
    .timer.reset {
      animation: reset 6s linear infinite;
    }
    .paused {
      animation: show-paused 6s linear infinite;
    }
    .cacheable {
      animation: flash-cache 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .reached {
      animation: flash-reached 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
  }

  @keyframes probe-before {
    0% {
      transform: translateX(0);
      opacity: 0;
    }
    6% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    30%,
    40% {
      transform: translateX(48px);
      opacity: 1;
    }
    64% {
      transform: translateX(0);
      opacity: 1;
    }
    70%,
    100% {
      transform: translateX(0);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  @keyframes probe-after {
    0% {
      transform: translateX(0);
      opacity: 0;
    }
    6% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
    34%,
    42% {
      transform: translateX(208px);
      opacity: 1;
    }
    70% {
      transform: translateX(0);
      opacity: 1;
    }
    76%,
    100% {
      transform: translateX(0);
      opacity: 0;
    }
  }
  @keyframes drain {
    0% {
      transform: scaleX(1);
    }
    85%,
    100% {
      transform: scaleX(0);
    }
  }
  @keyframes show-paused {
    0%,
    84% {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    88%,
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }
  @keyframes reset {
    0% {
      transform: scaleX(0.55);
    }
    34% {
      transform: scaleX(0.4);
    }
    37% {
      transform: scaleX(1);
    }
    100% {
      transform: scaleX(0.55);
    }
  }
  @keyframes flash-cache {
    0%,
    28%,
    44%,
    100% {
      fill: var(--bg-subtle);
    }
    32%,
    38% {
      fill: var(--border);
    }
  }
  @keyframes flash-reached {
    0%,
    32%,
    46%,
    100% {
      fill: var(--bg-subtle);
    }
    36%,
    42% {
      fill: var(--border);
    }
  }
</style>
